      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"The reason light probes don't help here is because they can't dim realtime lights shining on an avatar. They only add light to them.\"\nThis is no longer the case in Unity 2018. You can bake Occlusion Probes, which bakes the sun light's visibility into each light probe when using Mixed lighting.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
