      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While the reasoning here is focused more on something that'd be solved by occlusion probes, Distance Shadowmask would still allow for better quality worlds when used properly by creators. I have some use-cases where shadowing outside of the real-time shadow range is required, but I don't want to lose the close-up quality like I do with normal Shadowmask. \nAllowing world creators to use Distance Shadowmask would provide ample opportunity for more large-open worlds with high-quality performant shadows.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
